    "message": "Check each social and body relationship record inline every tick\n\nEvery tick checks every relationship (about 9,800 at day 7). The record checks\nnow compare key views with a constant set and read the counts directly instead\nof building a set and running generators per record, accepting exactly what\nthe field-by-field rules accepted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
